# Pairs with MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites. The allocator assigns an offset
# without checking the move fence (WalMoveFenceCore.IsAppendAdmitted is
# skipped), so a write appended after the copy is acknowledged on the old home
# and lost at the switch.
MODULE: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWritesAppendIgnoresFence
TARGET: MovedStreamKeepsAckedWrites
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an append is admitted while a move has fenced the stream and is lost at the switch
PERTURBS: Append

--- FIND
    /\ move = "idle"
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the fence check is dropped from the append.
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- END